# 9. Important Nikto Options

Common options include:

| Option | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `-h` | Target host |
| `-p` | Specify port(s) |
| `-ssl` | Force SSL/TLS testing where applicable |
| `-o` | Save output |
| `-Format` | Specify output format |
| `-Tuning` | Select categories of tests |
| `-timeout` | Set timeout |
| `-Display` | Control displayed information |

Exact behavior can vary by Nikto version.

