# 13. Nikto vs Nmap

| Nmap | Nikto |
|---|---|
| Network/service discovery | Web-server scanning |
| Port scanning | HTTP/web checks |
| Service/version detection | Web-server configuration/content checks |
| Broad network focus | Web-server focus |
| Can identify web ports | Investigates web services |

### Example

```text
Nmap
 ↓
80/tcp open http
443/tcp open https

Nikto
 ↓
