# 37. False Positives in Web Scanning

A scanner may report:

```text
Potential vulnerable component
```

But the component may:

- Not actually be present
- Be a different version
- Have a vendor patch
- Be protected by another control
- Not be reachable in the relevant way

Therefore:

```text
Scanner
 ↓
Potential Finding
 ↓
Verify
 ↓
Confirmed / False Positive
```

