# 41. Web Server Scanning Report Structure

A professional report can contain:

## 1. Executive Summary

Short overview.

## 2. Scope

What systems were tested.

## 3. Methodology

Tools and methods used.

## 4. Technology Profile

Technologies identified.

## 5. Findings

Potential/confirmed issues.

## 6. Evidence

Supporting observations.

## 7. Risk

Severity and business impact.

## 8. Recommendations

How to fix the issue.

## 9. Retest

Confirm remediation.

---

# 42. Remediation Examples

### Directory Listing

Disable unnecessary directory indexing.

### Backup Files

Remove them from public directories.

### Debug Mode

Disable debug mode in production.

### Outdated Software

Upgrade to a supported version after compatibility testing.

### Excessive Information Disclosure

Reduce unnecessary server/version information.

### Weak TLS

Use modern TLS configurations according to organizational requirements.

